{"seq":21,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T16:23:21.101Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"d44dde2cfa0c55ecffeeba6461ad167cf97e70c6c53298f5f0f3afdbe2ff0421","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","text":"Dana, here are the Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers I can find in Moss's notes. Two sources conflict, so I've flagged that.\n\n1. PD-4492: Pemberline Dock kiosk SMS bay assignments not reaching drivers at the Eau Claire yard (dock doors 14-18). Thea Ramaswell submitted it 4 Oct 2025. Support patched it, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct 04:00 shift cleared. Source: teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md (Moss, Sunday prep for Ruth, 5 Oct 2025).\n\n2. #4419: gatehouse barcode scanners failing to read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift, escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing. Source: teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md (Moss, undated North cheat sheet).\n\nConflict: Marcus Lindqvist's note members/marcus-lindqvist/notes/2025-07-14-marcus-q2-expansion-wrap.md also cites #4419, but describes it as Gate 3 printer lag (bol printout delay) with a patch pushed. It is Marcus's note, not Moss's. Worth confirming with Thea or support which description is right.\n\nNot included: #4409 and #4412 in Moss's Central handoffs digest are on another account (Pree's dealer account), not QFL. The Quarendon Freightways note is a different company with no ticket numbers.\n\nMoss's own notes folder came back empty, so these come from the team-north digests and the shared brain. I didn't find QFL ticket numbers in #north-team or #inc-qfl-sev1."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":22,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T16:23:26.441Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"85fa6fc4c4670759468a1a5cf3dc1a2dbff1d2b6574413b01a51e5cf0cba2e17","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","text":"I posted the list in our DM. It has two QFL ticket numbers, and one of them conflicts across sources:\n\n1. **PD-4492** (Eau Claire kiosk SMS bay assignments). Source: teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md, Moss's Sunday prep for Ruth.\n2. **#4419** (Door 14 barcode scanners, third shift). Source: teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md, Moss's undated North cheat sheet.\n\nMarcus Lindqvist's note (members/marcus-lindqvist/notes/2025-07-14-marcus-q2-expansion-wrap.md) also cites #4419, but describes it as Gate 3 printer lag. Someone should confirm the right description with Thea or support.\n\nMoss's own notes folder was empty, so these come from the team-north digests. I found no QFL ticket numbers in #north-team or #inc-qfl-sev1.\n\nI haven't written anything to the weekly notes, since I don't have a place to put them there. Tell me where you want the list and I can post it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
